}\b\fs24  \b0 What are some of the differences between writing and speaking skills? \par
\pard     \par
Ans: Learning to write is not a natural extention of learning to speak. Following are some differences between writing and speeking skill.\par
\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl\qc\b\fs22 Speech\par
\cell writing\cell\row\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl\b0 Speakers pronounce.\par
\cell Writers spell.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl Speech is usually informal and repetitive.\cell Whiting on the other hand is more formal and compact.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl Seekers draw own their listeners reactions to know how or wheter to continue.\cell Writers are often solitary in there process.even they d\rquote nt know where are their readers\cell\row\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl Speakers  use pauses and intonation.\par
\cell Writers use punctuations.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl Speakers can gauge the attitudes, beliefs nad fealings of their audience by there verbal and non verbal reactions.\cell Writers must consider what and how much there audience needs to know about a given topic.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl\cell\cell\row\trowd\trgaph108\trleft-108\trpaddl108\trpaddr108\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx4680\clbrdrl\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrw15\brdrs\brdrcf1 \cellx9468\pard\intbl\cell\cell\row\pard\fs24\par
\b\par
